#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../../../ (Documentation) / @../ (Builder packages) / @web/graphics

    # @web/graphics

    `@web/graphics` is the HTML builder's WebGL2 package. Its API will expose GPU
    resources, render state and draw calls through typed opaque handles while
    keeping WebGL's explicit graphics model.
